                "text": "Yesterday, Mountain Youth Academy, a trauma-based residential treatment facility located in Mountain City, announced the opening of its new facility in Johnson County. Mountain Youth Academy exclusively treats children and adolescents, both boys and girls ages 5\u201317. Their trauma treatment offers individual, group and family trauma therapy as well as other treatment methodologies to help youth deal with traumas they have experienced.",
