                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "In Erwin today, I had the opportunity to visit Lee Brown and the dedicated team at Erwin Utilities at their wastewater treatment plant, which was destroyed by flood waters. \n\nOur office is working closely with Lee\u2019s team and FEMA to ensure the rebuilding process moves forward as smoothly and quickly as possible. \n\nI want to thank Erwin Utilities for their incredible efforts in restoring power to so many residents in the aftermath of the storm. Your hard work is truly appreciated by the entire community!",
