                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today I was proud to vote for House passage of the bipartisan SUPPORT Act, reauthorizing President Trump\u2019s landmark law from his first term to continue the fight against the opioid and fentanyl crisis with initiatives that help prevent drug overdoses, provide access to treatment for those in need, and support opportunities for Americans recovering from substance use disorder.\n \nThe future of our nation depends on us solving the addiction and overdose crisis, and the SUPPORT Act is an important step towards that outcome.",
